-- Missing Review Messages: 58,256
-- Orders With Multiple Reviews: 547
-- Additional Review Records: 551
-- Maximum Reviews Per Order: 3

-- METRIC DEFINITIONS
-- Review Records counts review fact rows.
-- Distinct Reviewed Orders counts unique order IDs in reviews.
-- Orders With Reviews uses the order-level review flag.
-- Review Coverage is calculated by purchase cohort.
-- High-rating share counts scores 4 and 5 among valid scores.
-- Written feedback means title OR message is present.
-- Multiple-review statistics use review records per order.

-- DATE FILTER BEHAVIOR
-- Purchase Date filters review records by associated order.
-- Review Date filters review records by creation date.
-- Review Date does not filter fact_orders.

-- CAUTION
-- Average Review Score is review-record weighted.
-- Do not describe it as an order-weighted average.
-- Review Coverage does not measure customer retention.

